  "id": "cauliflower-and-green-bean-curry",
  "name": "Cauliflower and Green Bean Curry",
  "subtitle": "A hearty vegetable curry with coconut yogurt and lime",
  "description": "Tender squash, potatoes, cauliflower, and green beans simmer with aromatic spices and tomatoes, then finish with coconut yogurt, coriander, and lime. Serve with brown basmati rice.",
